  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.78 “Unit operating day” means a calendar day in which a unit combusts any fuel.\n\nSource. #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.74); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.79)",
